<span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;">The American Red Cross is proud to offer your students an opportunity to learn, take action, show leadership and receive recognition for their commitment in helping meet the blood needs of hospital patients in our community.</span></span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;">The Red Cross has over 70 years of experience in collecting and distributing blood to millions of patients in over 2,600 hospitals nationwide. </span></span><span style="color:#252525;"><span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;">Approximately 36,000 units of red blood cells are needed every day in the U.S. </span></span></span><span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;">and we could not do this lifesaving work without the support of our blood program partners. Approximately 20 percent of blood donations come from schools across the country. We hope you will join in!</span></span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;">We know your school faces many competing priorities. That&rsquo;s why we have designed our programs to be learning-in-action opportunities that will </span></span><span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;">develop and recognize students&rsquo; leadership, planning skills and humanitarian spirit.</span></span><span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;"> In addition to the rewarding feeling of helping save lives, your students will receive a variety of opportunities to be recognized and earn rewards. </span></span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<b><span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;">Hope begins with you.</span></span></b><span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;"> It begins with your school&rsquo;s decision to support the Red Cross and patients in need.&nbsp; It begins with a student&rsquo;s decision to support blood donation in your school or in the community.</span></span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<span style="font-family:georgia,serif;"><span style="font-size:11.0pt;">Please call me &nbsp;to learn about our programs for schools and explore the opportunities for a partnership with the American Red Cross.</span></span><br />
&nbsp;<br />
<br />
Thank you in advance for your consideration,<br />
